<h1 class="display-4">Help</h1>
<p class="lead">
    That confused feeling is how you know it&rsquo;s working. But
    don&rsquo;t worry&mdash;we&rsquo;ve got you covered.
</p>

<p>
    We&rsquo;ve all been there. What's the syntax for <kbd>SYNTAX</kbd>? Do I
    need <kbd>SET</kbd> or <kbd>SETG</kbd>? Why are the commas <em>before</em>
    the words? Luckily, you&rsquo;re not alone, and there are plenty of resources
    to help you get started with ZIL and ZILF. Here are a few good places to start:
</p>

